  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Add a button somewhere in the UI specifically to clear out the local \"show avatar\" settings (i.e. reset the \"show avatar\" setting for each individual). This could be very useful for many and help maintain better performance in conjunction with the safety tools already available. \n\nYou can have great safety settings and disable all very poors, set a low avatar download size limit, but it won't matter when you have individually shown 40 friends/users in a 80 person lobby. Just one very poor avatar can ruin someone's day and crash your application even with a very powerful PC, as we all know. I really believe this could be very useful and have wished this would be a feature at some point instead of having to find it in my app data and delete it manually or having to go through and reset the setting for every user you have shown.",
